# [[kiwi fruit]] {{gloss|a [[Chinese gooseberry]] [[vine]] [[fruit]] of the [[genus]] ''Actinidia'' with [[hairy]] [[brown]] [[skin]] and [[dark]] [[green]] [[flesh]]}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''kivi''' ir subtropu auglis ar brūnu, pūkainu mizu un zaļu mīkstumu|the '''kiwi''' is a subtropical fruit with brown, hairy skin and green flesh|inline=1}}
